# Practice

#### Let’s try it out!

#### We’ll dive into how to use these tools as an educator in Module 3, Transforming Teaching with AI. For now, your primary goal should be getting started using an LLM and practicing good prompting strategies.


## Educator’s Choice

#### **1. Choose an LLM.** Click on the image to open the link in a new tab.

#### If your school/district uses a particular LLM (even if it's not on the list below), we recommend that you practice using that one.


<div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;width:95%;margin:20pt auto;padding:0 5px;">
  <div style="width:20%;text-align:center;">
    <a href="https://chatgpt.com/" target="_blank">
      <img src="https://images.code.org/c22ec02e808ca32157566d9fb91efbe0-Screenshot%202026-01-29%20at%2011.40.54%20AM.png" alt="ChatGPT Logo" style="display:block;width:100%;height:auto !important;max-height:90px;object-fit:contain;border-radius:5pt;margin:0 auto;">
    </a>
  </div>
  <div style="width:20%;text-align:center;">
