      <img src="https://images.code.org/4ac56eafff87360544c03cc012c9bd4a-Screenshot%202026-01-29%20at%2011.40.17%20AM.png" alt="Claude Logo" style="display:block;width:100%;height:auto !important;max-height:90px;object-fit:contain;border-radius:5pt;margin:0 auto;">
