      <img src="https://images.code.org/bbfada5f0e117d70f873c77c7271e7eb-images.jpg" alt="Copilot Logo" style="display:block;width:100%;height:auto !important;max-height:90px;object-fit:contain;border-radius:5pt;margin:0 auto;">
